---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import OfferCard from '../../components/OfferCard.astro';
import inPerson from '../../assets/posters/course-prayer-in-person.jpg';
import zoom from '../../assets/posters/course-prayer-zoom.jpg';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Courses"
  eyebrow="Journey with me"
  intro="Deeper learning on prayer, healing and the spiritual life."
>
  <OfferCard
    kind="A four-week course on prayer"
    title="Love the Lord Your God"
    format="In person or on Zoom"
    posters={[
      { src: inPerson, alt: 'Poster for Love the Lord Your God, a four-week course on prayer, in person at Clarendon Street Church' },
      { src: zoom, alt: 'Poster for the online version of Love the Lord Your God on Zoom' },
    ]}
    topics={['Ignatian contemplation', 'Lectio Divina', 'Praying with the Psalms', 'Silence']}
    subject="Love the Lord Your God: expressing interest"
  >
    <p>In order to grow closer to God, we need to grow in prayer. We will explore how to pray with our heart, mind, emotions and in silence.</p>
    <p>When we show up, we create space to allow God to show up for us. Fr Mike Schmitz calls this a “near occasion of grace”.</p>
  </OfferCard>
</PageLayout>
